			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -όμενα πρήγματα</span>
			matters <i>that were brought</i> to him, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.173
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>deal with, behave oneself</i> in a certain way <i>towards</i>
			a person, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ ἴσου ὑμῖν
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.140
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς κρείσσοσι καλῶς</span>”
